    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "The preferred natural habitat of C. adamsi is savanna."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Description",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "Small for its genus, C. adamsi has a snout-to-vent length (SVL) of less than 4 cm (1.6 in) as an adult."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Behavior",
    "level": 2,
